Django Notes

Install Django - pip3 install Django

Start project (creates manage.py and other files) - Django-admin startproject vorokblog (project name)

run local Django server (where file is located like manage.py) - python3 manage.py runserver

install virtual environment - pip3 install virtualenv

create a new virtual environment - virtualenv nameofenv (name of environment)

activate virtual environment - source nameofenv/bin/activate
			to deactivate   - deactivate

Shows all things installed with pip - pip freeze

Migrates models (17 unapplied migrations) - python3 mangage.py migrate

Checks models.py for new models or changes to models to be added to dB - python3 manage.py makemigrations
